 "summaries": [
  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2018-10-19",
   "text": "Protection from Algal Toxins Act\n This bill amends the Safe Drinking Water Act to require the Environmental Protection Agency to publish a maximum contaminant level goal and promulgate a national primary drinking water regulation for microcystin toxin, which is produced by certain cyanobacteria (blue-green algae)."
  }
